WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.830
If you take iron supplements or a multivitamin that contains iron, please stop

2
00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:05.360
taking them

3
00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:07.900
about one week before your procedure.

4
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:10.760
Iron can interfere with your bowel prep and make it harder to see clearly

5
00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:12.680
during the colonoscopy.

6
00:00:12.680 --> 00:00:16.990
Check your multivitamin label too, as many contain iron even if it's not

7
00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:17.520
obvious.

8
00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:21.070
If you're unsure whether a specific supplement is okay to continue, reach out

9
00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:21.920
to your doctor's

10
00:00:21.920 --> 00:00:23.680
office before making any changes.
